From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:56:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2943/3799] soh: rename func_80B40E88 -> EnXc_NextAfterAction77

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from action 77 to 78
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 2d4f8a72f..01be93820 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -2063,7 +2063,8 @@ void EnXc_NextAfterNocturneThrowNut(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_NOCTURNE_THROW_NUT, SHEIK_ACTION_77);
 }
 
-void func_80B40E88(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B40E88: the same guard from action 77 to 78
+void EnXc_NextAfterAction77(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_77, SHEIK_ACTION_78);
 }
 
@@ -2244,7 +2245,7 @@ void EnXc_ThrowNutInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_DeleteInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_Delete(this, play);
-    func_80B40E88(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterAction77(this);  // was func_80B40E88 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_KillInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
